{"2936530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Science Skaters", "steam_appid": 2936530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fearful entity has taken over the world, but luckily the key to fight back is <strong>hidden inside your best friend’s body</strong>! A team of young, adventurous and brilliant scientists will shrink their bodies and use their <strong>skating skills</strong> to get inside their friend’s body and explore a world like they have never seen before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Max, Jin, Lia and Zev in this fun adventure and skate around thanks to their <strong>customizable nano-skates</strong>, solve science <strong>puzzles</strong> adapted to <strong>different ages</strong>. <strong>Explore</strong>, learn and <strong>fight</strong> to save the future of humanity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKATE YOUR WAY THROUGH NEW WORLDS!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 25 different levels to explore, full of action and adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+60 challenges to overcome: lasers, puzzles, typhoons, sticky walls, broken bridges, falling rocks…</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defeat or flee from lots of different types of enemies inside each level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant, fun and colorful world inspired by the inside of the human body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to find the ultimate nanobot formula to save the world?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936530/extras/a72618cee373f5280c34e5dd33694bed.poster.avif?t=1761560766\" width=950 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936530/extras/a72618cee373f5280c34e5dd33694bed.webm?t=1761560766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936530/extras/a72618cee373f5280c34e5dd33694bed.mp4?t=1761560766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL UP YOUR SKILLS AND CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 scientists to choose and play with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ items to customize your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your nano-tools and get even stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 nano-skills to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936530/extras/dc112444ae813a4ca42a9858287fc8a7.poster.avif?t=1761560766\" width=1170 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936530/extras/dc112444ae813a4ca42a9858287fc8a7.webm?t=1761560766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936530/extras/dc112444ae813a4ca42a9858287fc8a7.mp4?t=1761560766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN, COLLECT AND KEEP THE FUN ROLLING!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles adapted to age</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun facts about science to find and learn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the human body while saving the world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fearful entity has taken over the world, but luckily the key to fight back is <strong>hidden inside your best friend’s body</strong>! A team of young, adventurous and brilliant scientists will shrink their bodies and use their <strong>skating skills</s